{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"2\n    \n      Rich Garden Immersion RECOMMENDED\n      Reimagine the existing sections with more creative layouts (asymmetry, overlapping elements, generous breathing room mixed with intimate details). Add 4–5 signature interactive gimmicks that feel native to the garden theme:\n      \n        Hero with responsive falling petals + a soft blooming countdown\n        Our Story as a winding garden path (cards that literally \"bloom\" open with more vivid memory details + optional photo placeholders)\n        Event \"map\" as a stylized illustrated garden path with flower/lantern markers you can tap to reveal schedule details\n        RSVP success with living card (petals + a personalized flower that grows) + a \"Plant Your Wish\" live garden wall\n        Subtle sticky garden navigation (flower icons) and a poetic footer\n      \n      \n      \n        Sample enhanced content:\n        2020 First Trip — \"We wandered misty mountain gardens and planted a young sapling together — the first tree in what would become our story.\"\n        Reception Hiroen — The Grand Orchard Pavilion, 5:30 PM – late (evening garden banquet under the stars).\n      \n\n      Trade-offs: Delivers exactly the \"more beautiful, colorful, and more interactive gimmick\" you asked for while staying focused on the original core features. Slightly more development effort but highly memorable without feeling cluttered.","choice":"immersion","id":null,"timestamp":1781257411112}
